n't implicate him in what  happened to aaron at all  in fact it makes it feel unlikely that  he had anything to do with what happened  to her  i'm left thinking that whether she met  someone on the site or not  its existence shows that there's  definitely a market for young women to  make money through hooking up with older  men  in this town it's popular enough that  her as a regular high school girl for  all intents and purposes knew about it  and that her friend was willing to help  her set up an account to me that makes  me wonder about all the adult men  that we've met in the show pretty much  any of them could have been using the  website  she did use a fake name but anyone that  knew her would recognize her if they  went on there  and come on the whole premise of this  show is that everyone knows everyone  else i think that's a good place to  leave things let's pick up the  conversation in the comments  tell me your theories and what's on your  mind after the episode  in the next few days i'll follow this up  i'll put out another video talking about  the trailer there's a lot going on in  that  plus i'll get into my theories along  with some of the other interesting ones  that are out there  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon
 

